\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Robustness decay under Gaussian SCADA corruption. Panel~(a) focuses on the deep model comparison, showing that Ultra-LSNT maintains positive skill ($R^2=0.786$) at severe corruption ($\sigma _{\mathrm  {eff}}=0.60$), albeit below iTransformer and TimeMixer. Panel~(b) provides the full performance envelope, highlighting the catastrophic collapse of DLinear to negative $R^2$ and the intermediate robustness of LightGBM. Operating zones: nominal ($\sigma _{\mathrm  {eff}}\leq 0.15$), degraded ($0.15<\sigma _{\mathrm  {eff}}\leq 0.30$), and severe ($\sigma _{\mathrm  {eff}}>0.30$).}}{23}{figure.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
